# Cloud Infrastructure & Automation Guidelines
- Environment: Ubuntu WSL2, Python 3, Boto3, Docker, LocalStack.
- Cloud Target: AWS (EC2, S3, Lambda, VPC, RDS, SNS/SQS).
- IaC / Config: Terraform, Docker Compose.
- Testing: When writing AWS automation or mock scripts, default to LocalStack endpoints (http://localhost:4566) unless production configs are specified.
- Style: Modular, type-hinted Python functions with clear error handling and cleanup logic. Avoid hardcoded credentials.